  "releaseNotes": "*\tAdded CSV File Support to DataStandardizer (#39)\n*\tUpdate read-csv-files.md (#38)\n*\tUpdated README with project documentation link (#37)\n*\tAdded comprehensive user guides for Data Standardizer packages (#36)\n*\tEnhanced CSV File Support in DataStandardizer.File (#35)\n*\tAdd new projects for language, geography, and language tag support (#34)\n*\tdocs: Add DataStandardizer.File package details to README (#33)\n*\tdocs: Update project metadata for DataStandardizer.File (#30)\n*\tfeat: Add DataStandardizer.File project for CSV file handling (#29)\n*\tdocs: add support section to README (#28)\n*\tCreate FUNDING.yml (#27)\n*\tdocs: Update README with improved package descriptions and release table (#26)\n*\tdocs: Update README to include DataStandardizer.Chronology (#23)\n*\tfeat: Add DataStandardizer.Chronology project and tests (#22)\n*\tfeat: Rename enum and related types to follow naming convention. (#18)\n*\tEnhance CI pipeline for package version handling (#15)\n*\tFix defect in PS script for \"Set version arguments\" CI pipeline step. (#14)\n*\t#4335: Added money data type. (#8)\n*\tfix: Update logging behavior in CI pipeline for package versioning (#11)\n*\tfix: Enhance CI pipeline logic for package versioning and branch handling (#10)",
